<title>USA: Photronics Inc Q4 Oct 31 net rises. [CORRECTED 1:45 GMT 11/12]</title>
<headline>Photronics Inc Q4 Oct 31 net rises. [CORRECTED 1:45 GMT 11/12]</headline>
<dateline>JUPITER, Fla. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>				 Three months ended	Year ended</p>
<p>				     1996     1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		     $42,212 $36,232  $160,071 $125,299</p>
<p> Net income			5,572   5,085    21,003   18,632</p>
<p> Net income per common share  0.46    0.42	1.74     1.66</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common shares outstanding</p>
<p>				    12,196  12,113    12,101   11,207</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 year includes a non-recurring charge related to the acquisition of Microphase Laboratories, Inc. of $1.5 million ($0.9 million, or $0.08 per share, after tax).</p>
<p>1995 year (Company corrects from 1994 Q4) includes a net gain from the sale of equity investments of $4.7 million ($2.9 million, or $0.24 per share, after tax)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
